{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-aeon-adjacency","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:aeon-adjacency","kind":"definition","title":"Aeon adjacency","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-aeon","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-aeon-boundary"],"tags":["aeon","jet-horizon","adjacency","cyclic-cosmology","big-bang"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.aeonAdjacent","text":"aeon-adjacency.md","leanSource":"aeon-adjacency.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:aeon-adjacency\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A}</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A}'</code> be aeons  with boundaries <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\partial\\mathcal{A}</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\partial\\mathcal{A}'</code> .</p>\n<p>Two aeons <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A}</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A}'</code> stand in <strong>aeon adjacency</strong> (are <strong>adjacent</strong>) if their boundaries share a common object:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\partial\\mathcal{A} \\cap \\partial\\mathcal{A}' \\neq \\varnothing.</code></pre>\n<p>The shared boundary object simultaneously represents the terminal horizon of one aeon and the initial configuration of the next. It categorically realises one cosmological cycle handing off to the next.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/aeon-adjacency.md","heading":"Definition","number":"22.12.11","page":"b/def-aeon-adjacency","qa":{"counts":{"pass":80,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":64},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.aeonAdjacent","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/aeon-adjacency.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
